                              Notes on extlib

1. Getting the current path overflows on large paths, this should be
able to get any size path. The key is to call getenvironment twice,
once to get the length of string, and the second time to actually
get the data.

2. Getenv should return a nil pointer for dynamic results if the
environment string is not defined. The code looks like it returns
an empty string instead. Check.

3. The times and dates functions, and everything that calls them,
should use the system time and date format specifications to format
the time as per the users settings.

4. Change chkfil to use windows style characters.